%% find-it-campus · POST /api/match 调用时序（含失败出口）
%% 事实来源：MatchController / MatchService / MatchCandidatePoolPort / KeywordMatchEngine / MatchResultMapper
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant C as 浏览器
  participant Ctl as MatchController
  participant Svc as MatchService
  participant Pool as MatchCandidatePoolPort
  participant Eng as MatchEngine
  participant DB as MySQL

  C->>Ctl: POST /api/match {text, type?, categoryId?, topN?, minScore?, excludeRecordId?}
  Ctl->>Svc: match(request)
  Svc->>Svc: 校验 text（30001）· topN/minScore/type（10001）· categoryId 存在性（40001）

  alt 引擎未装配（30002）
    Svc-->>C: 503 · code 30002 · data.engine
  else 引擎已装配
    Svc->>Pool: load(type, categoryId, poolSize=500)
    Pool->>DB: SELECT ... WHERE status='PENDING' AND deleted_at IS NULL LIMIT 500
    Pool-->>Svc: List<MatchCandidateSource>
    Svc->>Svc: 剔除 excludeRecordId
    Svc->>Eng: match(candidates, query)
    alt MatchEngineException
      Eng-->>Svc: UNAVAILABLE / TIMEOUT
      Svc-->>C: 503 · 30002 / 504 · 30003
    else 正常返回
      Eng-->>Svc: List<MatchCandidate>(recordId, score, reason)
      Svc->>Svc: minScore 过滤 → 去重 → score DESC, recordId ASC → 截断 topN
      Svc->>DB: selectSummariesByIds(ids)（再校验未删除且 PENDING）
      Svc->>DB: INSERT t_match_result（失败仅 WARN，不影响响应）
      Svc-->>C: 200 · code 0 · items（score / scorePercent / reason / 展示字段）
    end
  end
